# Malformed programs (sourced by run.sh; ruling S28). The oracle is Souffle's refusal: the first Error line of the
# program in refuse/NAME.dl, without its file and line. The seed engine and the engine of stigi must refuse the same
# programs with the codes rule-unsafe, negation-cycle, relation-arity and unresolved-name.
for x in unboundHead unboundNegation unboundComparison negationCycle negationSelf relationArity unknownRelation stratifiedOk; do queue refuse refuse "$x" "" refuse; done
